### Converts `me` to `CSSize`.
### :returns: The same numeric value as an `CSSize`.
### :throws: Crashes with `IntegerOverflowError` when the value does not fit in `CSSize`.
@target(size: 64)
@track_caller
routine U256.to[CSSize]() -> CSSize
    if not (me <= 9223372036854775807)
        crash_overflow()
    r: CSSize = trunc[Me, CSSize](me)
    return r

